   <section class="pf-experience-intro"> 
      <div class="pf-container">
        <div class="pf-experience-intro__content">
          <h1>Realize a life that fits you</h1>
        <div class="pf-experience-intro__text">
          Project Frida helps you get to the root of why your life kablooey. We then work with you to
          identify the patterns you know need to change, clarify your dreams and experiment with
          creating a new life.
          <br />
          <br />
          There is nothing wrong with you&mdash;we just help you bridge the knowing and doing gap.
          In the end, we decrease the time it would have taken you to get there.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pf-experience"> 
      <div class="pf-container">
        <div class="pf-experience__content">


          <div class="pf-experience__text">
          <div class="pf-experience__header">
            <div class="pf-experience__img">
              <img src="../assets/images/dive.png" height="240px" alt="Dive"/>
              <div class="pf-experience__step">
                <div class="pf-experience__step_item"><h3>DIVE</h3></div>
                <div class="pf-experience__step_item">into what is</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pf-experience__header">
            <div class="pf-experience__img">
              <img src="../assets/images/dream.png" height="240px" alt="Dream"/>
              <div class="pf-experience__step">
                <div class="pf-experience__step_item"><h3>DREAM</h3></div>
                <div class="pf-experience__step_item">what could be</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pf-experience__header">
            <div class="pf-experience__img">
              <img src="../assets/images/do.png" height="130px" alt="Do"/>
              <div class="pf-experience__step">
                <div class="pf-experience__step_item"><h3>DO</h3></div>
                <div class="pf-experience__step_item">it in life</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          </div>


          <div class="pf-divider"></div>

          <div class="pf-experience__summary">
            <h3>Over 6 weeks, you'll work on</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <span class="heavy">Reframing your story:</span> transform your challenging experiences into sources of strength
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="heavy">Articulating your needs:</span> establish a deeper connection with yourself and identify what you need
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="heavy">Taking action:</span> experiment with tangible steps toward realizing a new life
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="heavy">Surrendering control:</span> strengthen your ability to navigate continued disruptions
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>


        </div>  
      </div>
    </section>

   <section class="pf-people"> 
      <div class="pf-container">
        <div class="pf-people__text">
          <h2>People we've worked with</h2>
          <p>
            We've worked with extraordinary people who are highly capable in multiple fields.
            They are hyper-independent, have high expectations of 
            themselves, self-aware, reflective, neurodivergent, and have always known that they were capable
            of much more despite all they've achieved. There's no challenge that they haven't been able to overcome 
            or do ... until their lives went kablooey. 
          </p>
          <p>
            <span class="heavy">Challenges:</span> life-threatening illnesses, professional disruptions, identity challenges,
            relational ruptures, and more.
          </p>
          <p>
            They reached the point where they could not solve what they were facing alone.

            They understood the gravity of the moment,
            knew a major shift was happening and needed support and constructive challenge from us.

          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pf-case"> 
      <div class="pf-container">
          <h2>People's experiences</h2>
        <div class="pf-case__text">
          <p>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left quote"></i>
            I was curious about how Frida would be different from coaching. I was surprised by how
            energizing the process was, and how much it helped me reimagine my desires for the
            future. Each step was valuable in its own way. The process encourages looking at
            yourself as a whole person as a centering principle which is incredibly refreshing. I
            highly recommend the program for anyone who is going through a major life transition.
          </p>
          <p>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left quote"></i>
            I was surprised at the process because I've never gone through a structured one like
            this before. The mirroring by people who have known me deeply was a weird experience. I
            kind of knew most of the stuff, but hearing it reflected made it more real. The biggest
            thing that has changed would be that I
            feel like a co-creator of my experience. At the beginning, I was in a dark tunnel and I
            could sense the light somewhere in the future, but old stuff clouded my perception. The
            qualitative difference now is I feel more intimacy with life and the present moment. I
            feel more me.
          </p>
        </div>
          <p>
            <a href="https://lifegonekablooey.substack.com/welcome">
              Read more on Substack
              <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square"></i>
            </a>
          </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pf-who">
      <div class="pf-container">
